        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gabriel Gustafson\n- Projects: Oseberg excavation and conservation\n- Products: Oseberg Ship\n- Places: Oseberg farm, Tønsberg, Vestfold county, Norway\n\nFacts:\n- Gabriel Gustafson was responsible for the excavation and conservation of the Oseberg Ship, also called the Osebergfunnet.\n- The Oseberg Ship, or Osebergskipet in Norwegian, is a well-preserved Viking ship.\n- The Oseberg Ship was discovered in a large burial mound at the Oseberg farm near Tønsberg in Vestfold county, Norway.",
